   "title": "A yacht that lives with you",
   "intro": "Step aboard and discover interiors designed to enhance life at sea. Available in three or four cabin layouts, each stateroom offers plush comfort with voluminous bathrooms, upgraded fixtures, and elegant finishes. A centrally located galley means you are always just a few steps away from the yacht’s key areas – the helm, the flybridge, the salon and adjacent “terrace on the sea”.\nShe is a vessel of intuitive ergonomics, meaning her functionality is immediately obvious, and it takes just a few days to make you feel like you are one with your boat.\nWhat’s more, she offers in standard equipment many features that are often optional – Sleipner fins, upgraded batteries and tableware to name a few – meaning that the Grand Trawler is ready to go the distance from the moment you get the keys in hand.",
